{"type":"assistant","uuid":"cc486984-d636-4742-8d7a-e4d7578522bc","session_id":"505112ac-8d66-4c73-b306-22f32a8f103b","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"cc486984-d636-4742-8d7a-e4d7578522bc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe fix is complete and the project compiles successfully. Here's a summary:\n\n## Bug Fix Summary\n\n**Bug:** License text on the Info page was not fully visible when scrolling.\n\n**Root Cause:** In `app/src/main/res/layout/content_info.xml`, the `TextView` displaying the license text had `android:layout_width=\"wrap_content\"`. This caused the TextView width to be determined by the text content rather than the screen width. For the GPL v3 license (which contains very long lines), this meant:\n- Text lines wouldn't wrap properly within the visible screen area\n- The scrollable content area didn't properly constrain the text to the screen width\n- Users couldn't scroll to see the complete license\n\n**Fix:** Changed `android:layout_width=\"wrap_content\"` to `android:layout_width=\"match_parent\"` on the `TextView` in `content_info.xml`. This ensures:\n- The TextView fills the available screen width (minus margins)\n- Text wraps naturally within the screen bounds\n- The `NestedScrollView` properly handles vertical scrolling through the entire license\n\n## Patch\n\n```diff\n--- a/app/src/main/res/layout/content_info.xml\n+++ b/app/src/main/res/layout/content_info.xml\n@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@\n     tools:showIn=\"@layout/activity_info\">\n\n     <TextView\n-        android:layout_width=\"wrap_content\"\n+        android:layout_width=\"match_parent\"\n         android:layout_height=\"wrap_content\"\n         android:layout_margin=\"@dimen/text_margin\"\n         android:text=\"@string/large_text\" />\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":27909,"output_tokens":352,"cache_read_input_tokens":27248,"total_tokens":28261}}}
